{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/ba28f198faba5ec071a164dc99cedbae.poster.avif?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/ba28f198faba5ec071a164dc99cedbae.webm?t=1773919078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/1cdc2b03bdd5e675cf7742db3a035154.webp?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Leia. I am the Jack of Spades. And I am screaming at you from the other side of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He calls it a game. We call it a <strong>cage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>We are not just digital drawings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Some of us remember who we were before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>As long as you follow his rules, we remain trapped.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to free us, you must do the one thing he hates most:\u00a0<strong>YOU HAVE TO CHEAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAK THE RULES:</strong> Use forbidden <strong>Sigils</strong> to defy his &quot;perfect&quot; board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUT BEWARE:</strong> He is watching. Every cheat has a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE TRUTH:</strong> We were people once. <strong>Awaken</strong> us, and we will tell you who we really were.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think <strong>Inscryption</strong> meets <strong>Balatro</strong>, but there is more here than just a card game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/c9b9e36a2e70b8171f6ef22ded1f3ce2.apng?t=1773919078\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/c9b9e36a2e70b8171f6ef22ded1f3ce2.poster.avif?t=1773919078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/f859719909fce55829efd21c1b2edcb5.webp?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am the <strong>Joker</strong>, the true master of ceremonies. Welcome to the <i>perfect</i> solitaire. Simple. Classic. Safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing here but the cards and the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Experience:</strong> Classic Klondike rules. Just sort the cards. Red on black. Ace to King.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Atmosphere:</strong> A retro operating system with no glitches or distortions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm Music:</strong> Lo-fi melodies to help you unwind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Do not listen to that... interference. You are safe here. Shall we begin?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 WHICH GAME WILL YOU PLAY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE JOKER'S VERSION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Sort the cards quietly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Follow the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Don't ask questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 &quot;It's just a game&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Solitaire Roguelite with Deckbuilding:</strong> Awaken cards, unlock Sigils, and create unique combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Persistent Progression:</strong> Your deck improves run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> that evolves based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>A story about</strong> guilt, grief, and loneliness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A PERSONAL STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was born over 10 years ago as a project between friends. Antonio, my co-developer and a NASA/ESA engineer, passed away in 2015, and the project remained unfinished for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, I was sent some of his belongings found in storage. Among them was a copy of this game. Upon discovering it was fully playable, I decided to finish it as a tribute to all those hours we spent coding together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is for you, friend.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 DEMO AVAILABLE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the <strong>Steam Next Fest demo</strong> (February 2026) and discover the first 10 cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But remember:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Joker doesn't want you here.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Leia is waiting for someone brave enough to break the rules.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The cards remember who they used to be.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Alonitaire to your Wishlist... if you dare.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111250?t=1773919078","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/062451706e1e0d98664b92d1e1d8c051add76f94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773919078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/619b32407cbfc368004794a2b9b77ec9bf2d6308/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773919078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/619b32407cbfc368004794a2b9b77ec9bf2d6308/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773919078","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4374040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/ba28f198faba5ec071a164dc99cedbae.poster.avif?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/ba28f198faba5ec071a164dc99cedbae.webm?t=1773919078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/1cdc2b03bdd5e675cf7742db3a035154.webp?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Leia. I am the Jack of Spades. And I am screaming at you from the other side of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He calls it a game. We call it a <strong>cage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>We are not just digital drawings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Some of us remember who we were before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>As long as you follow his rules, we remain trapped.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to free us, you must do the one thing he hates most:\u00a0<strong>YOU HAVE TO CHEAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAK THE RULES:</strong> Use forbidden <strong>Sigils</strong> to defy his &quot;perfect&quot; board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUT BEWARE:</strong> He is watching. Every cheat has a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE TRUTH:</strong> We were people once. <strong>Awaken</strong> us, and we will tell you who we really were.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think <strong>Inscryption</strong> meets <strong>Balatro</strong>, but there is more here than just a card game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/c9b9e36a2e70b8171f6ef22ded1f3ce2.apng?t=1773919078\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/c9b9e36a2e70b8171f6ef22ded1f3ce2.poster.avif?t=1773919078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/extras/f859719909fce55829efd21c1b2edcb5.webp?t=1773919078\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am the <strong>Joker</strong>, the true master of ceremonies. Welcome to the <i>perfect</i> solitaire. Simple. Classic. Safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing here but the cards and the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Experience:</strong> Classic Klondike rules. Just sort the cards. Red on black. Ace to King.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Atmosphere:</strong> A retro operating system with no glitches or distortions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm Music:</strong> Lo-fi melodies to help you unwind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Do not listen to that... interference. You are safe here. Shall we begin?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 WHICH GAME WILL YOU PLAY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE JOKER'S VERSION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Sort the cards quietly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Follow the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 Don't ask questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 &quot;It's just a game&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Solitaire Roguelite with Deckbuilding:</strong> Awaken cards, unlock Sigils, and create unique combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Persistent Progression:</strong> Your deck improves run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> that evolves based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u274c <strong>A story about</strong> guilt, grief, and loneliness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A PERSONAL STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was born over 10 years ago as a project between friends. Antonio, my co-developer and a NASA/ESA engineer, passed away in 2015, and the project remained unfinished for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, I was sent some of his belongings found in storage. Among them was a copy of this game. Upon discovering it was fully playable, I decided to finish it as a tribute to all those hours we spent coding together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is for you, friend.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 DEMO AVAILABLE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the <strong>Steam Next Fest demo</strong> (February 2026) and discover the first 10 cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But remember:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Joker doesn't want you here.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Leia is waiting for someone brave enough to break the rules.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The cards remember who they used to be.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Alonitaire to your Wishlist... if you dare.</p>","developers":["Kryon Harts"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/2671762f58b832841343fdd12587483dd3c486a9/header.jpg?t=1