96530cf5995c10e7938f37f6df9c/ss_97ac74b0bfa896530cf5995c10e7938f37f6df9c.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/8e1eabcc701a447c21a2e90518b147d5c14ce99b/ss_8e1eabcc701a447c21a2e90518b147d5c14ce99b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/8e1eabcc701a447c21a2e90518b147d5c14ce99b/ss_8e1eabcc701a447c21a2e90518b147d5c14ce99b.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/f95701d936808e87dfa660df5b0f178ea4aeb31d/ss_f95701d936808e87dfa660df5b0f178ea4aeb31d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/f95701d936808e87dfa660df5b0f178ea4aeb31d/ss_f95701d936808e87dfa660df5b0f178ea4aeb31d.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/394f593ce7c6a271c119341763a2b99ec4fc008d/ss_394f593ce7c6a271c119341763a2b99ec4fc008d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/394f593ce7c6a271c119341763a2b99ec4fc008d/ss_394f593ce7c6a271c119341763a2b99ec4fc008d.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/55fc4d66189c06bb4f257754dad8bb9556025106/ss_55fc4d66189c06bb4f257754dad8bb9556025106.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/55fc4d66189c06bb4f257754dad8bb9556025106/ss_55fc4d66189c06bb4f257754dad8bb9556025106.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/2c7cc7db75ddb12e4a6cd039f08b431188ed2961/ss_2c7cc7db75ddb12e4a6cd039f08b431188ed2961.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/2c7cc7db75ddb12e4a6cd039f08b431188ed2961/ss_2c7cc7db75ddb12e4a6cd039f08b431188ed2961.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/d37899815bb4f520234e5f9e6ec7c2bef490e0c3/ss_d37899815bb4f520234e5f9e6ec7c2bef490e0c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773919078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111250/d37899815bb4f520234e5f9e6ec7c2bef490e0c3/ss_d37899815bb4f520234e5f9e6ec7c2bef490e0c3.600x338.jpg?t=1773919078"}],"short_description":"Break the rules of solitaire in this atmospheric roguelike deckbuilder. Unleash forbidden sigils while the Jack of Spades begs for your help in secret. Forge game-breaking combos under the Joker\u2019s watchful eye and uncover the truth behind the deck. Don\u2019t investigate\u2026 just play.","steam_appid":4111250,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://discord.gg/T7ZvBSey"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}